<tr valign="top" height="300" >
<td tEditID="c1r2" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; bEditID:r3st1; color:#000000; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r2" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[<p class="MsoNormal" style=""><font face="Arial, sans-serif" style="">Dear<span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 153);">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></span><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 153);">[Insert Name]</span>,</font></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style=""><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><br></font></p><p class="MsoNormal" style=""><font face="Arial, sans-serif">The American Red
Cross is proud to offer your students an opportunity to learn, take action,
show leadership and receive recognition for their commitment in helping meet
the blood needs of hospital patients in our community.<o:p></o:p></font></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: 4.5pt; background: white;"><o:p><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></o:p></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: 4.5pt; background: white;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><span style="color: black;">The
Red Cross has over 70 years of experience in collecting and distributing blood
to millions of patients in over 2,600 hospitals nationwide. </span><span style="color: rgb(37, 37, 37);">Approximately
36,000 units of red blood cells are needed every day in the U.S. </span><span style="color: black;">and we
could not do this lifesaving work without the support of our blood program
partners. Approximately 20 percent of blood donations come from schools across
the country. We hope you will join in!</span><span style="color: rgb(37, 37, 37);"><o:p></o:p></span></font></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style=""><o:p><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></o:p></p>

<p class="Default" style=""><font face="Arial, sans-serif">We
know your school faces many competing priorities. That’s why we have designed
our programs to be learning-in-action opportunities that will develop
and recognize students’ leadership, planning skills and humanitarian spirit. In addition to the rewarding
feeling of helping save lives, your students will receive a variety of
opportunities to be recognized and earn rewards. <o:p></o:p></font></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style=""><o:p><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></o:p></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style=""><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><b style="mso-bidi-font-weight:normal">Hope begins with you.</b> It begins with your school’s decision to
support the Red Cross and patients in need.&nbsp; It begins with a student’s
decision to support blood donation in your school or in the community.<o:p></o:p></font></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style=""><o:p><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></o:p></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style=""><font face="Arial, sans-serif">Please contact me to
learn about our programs for schools and explore the opportunities for a partnership
with the American Red Cross.<o:p></o:p></font></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style=""><o:p><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></o:p></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style=""><o:p><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></o:p></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: 0in; line-height: normal; vertical-align: baseline;"><span style="color: black;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">Sincerely,&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></font></span></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: 0in; line-height: normal; vertical-align: baseline;"><span class="ui-provider fy b c d e f g h i j k l m n o p q r s t u v w x y z ab ac ae af ag ah ai aj ak" dir="ltr" style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 102);"><font face="Arial, sans-serif" style="">[Insert Name]</font></span></p>]]></td>
</tr>
